d and it came out beautifully and delicious. Everyone eating it thought it was awesome. Added bonus is they were significantly cheaper than any of the other cupcake places I called in the area, such as Kupcake factory."},{"business_id":"qdwkoJ4AEnpo0L7Zwxx11g","review_id":"e8ZZVIh7lmJZE8uXLZipiA","date":"2013-09-12T19:35:43","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9085779190063477,"text_excerpt":"They all were very tasty (very rich and sweet), reasonable priced and very pretty. I would definitely recommend this place for your next cupcake cake occasion. Eating local never tasted so good!"}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
